"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"y"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", The easiest way to do so is to sort the line segments and try every consecutive 3."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Code : "},{"attrs":{"href":"http://pastebin.com/NsCkbQFS"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"http://pastebin.com/NsCkbQFS"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Time complexity : "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nlog"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"))."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"level":4},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Second solution :-"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Depending on the note from the first solution, If we try to generate a sequence such that after sorting, Every consecutive 3 line segments will form a degenerate triangle, It will be 1 1 2 3 5 8 13 ... which is Fibonacci sequence, Fibonacci is a fast growing sequence, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"fib"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"(45) = 1134903170, Notice that Fibonacci makes maximum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" with \"NO\" as the answer, That means the answer is indeed \"YES\" for "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≥ 45, For "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" < 45, You can do the naive "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3"}],"kind":"superscript"},{"kind":"text","text":") solution or the first solution."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Code : "},{"attrs":{"href"